<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 228 0 R /Rect [ 127.697998 111.57297 467.855011 268.223971 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure2) /TU (Updated Test Pyramid \("The Test Pyramid 2.0"\), enhancing the five layers with security testing and AI-assisted strategies. From bottom to top: Unit Testing with SAST, Component Tests with Security Controls Validation, Integration Testing with IAST, UI/API-level Testing with DAST, and Manual/Exploratory with Pen/Chaos Tests. AI-enabled tools are indicated on the right side and are applicable for all the layers for both application and security tests. Test execute speed and volume stays the same.) /Type /Annot >>
