<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Updated Test Pyramid \("The Test Pyramid 2.0"\), enhancing the five layers with security testing and AI-assisted strategies. From bottom to top: Unit Testing with SAST, Component Tests with Security Controls Validation, Integration Testing with IAST, UI/API-level Testing with DAST, and Manual/Exploratory with Pen/Chaos Tests. AI-enabled tools are indicated on the right side and are applicable for all the layers for both application and security tests. Test execute speed and volume stays the same.) /K 641 0 R /P 239 0 R /Pg 228 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
